        <tr>
        <td  class="rowalign" align="left"><strong>Job Description:</strong></td>
                      <td class="rowalign" align="left"> <ul class="ullist">
                          <li>Manages the Secretarial Compliance / Compliance Audit.</li>
                          <li>Compliance of legal and procedural aspects under various corporate laws and acts.</li>
                          <li>Advises the company on legal and statutory matters.</li>
                          <li>Drafting of Board/ Annual General Meeting Minutes, Directors Report, ensuring 100% Secretarial compliance.</li>
                          <li>Advising on good governance practices and compliance of Corporate Governance norms</li>
						  <li>Compliance of Company related laws as applicable to the company.</li>
						  <li>Responsible for drafting, review and vetting of all legal agreements of the organization related to Vendor agreement, NDAs, Client agreements, lease deeds etc.</li>
						  <li>Assisting in drafting legal contracts and commercial agreements and ensure that contracts are in compliance with legal, regulatory and organizational policies.</li>
						  <li>Standardization of agreements</li>
